    "initialSymptom": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "the-whole-disaster-started-with-a-two-second-cold-start-rattle",
          "title": "The whole disaster started with a two-second cold-start rattle.",
          "description": "The sound lasted only two seconds. That short window is why many owners ignore it until the chain snaps and the engine is destroyed.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/case-studies/assets/1.2-mercedes-om651-probably-fine.png",
              "alt": "Mercedes Sprinter OM651 owner ignored timing chain rattle thinking 'probably fine' - cost £7,000",
              "width": "",
              "height": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "What owner thought"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "“It’s probably fine”"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The van still drove normally, so the symptom did not feel urgent."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "What it actually was"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Tensioner failing"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The OM651 tensioner was losing hydraulic pressure, allowing chain to stretch and slap."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Why it matters"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Catastrophic snap"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Once the chain snaps, valves bend, pistons are damaged, and the engine is beyond repair."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "If your OM651 rattles on cold start — even for one second — book a timing chain inspection within 7 days. Do not wait for the chain to snap."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Failure timeline"
            }
          ],
